``marker`` / ``m``
    Marker spec. Set to ``None`` or ``""`` to suppress the marker.
``markersize`` / ``ms``, ``markeredgewidth`` / ``mew``
    Marker dimensions. ``markersize`` / ``ms`` denote marker diameter in points.
